  "description": "A chaotic local platform fighter where even the worst player can win.\n\nIn a world turned into a massive tip after humans disappeared, vermin have taken over. Rats, seagulls and other pests clash in an absurd monarchy for one thing only: to sit on the throne!\n\nRoyal Vermin is a 2 to 4 player local fighting game inspired by the best platform fighters, featuring ranged combat, chargeable projectiles and constantly unbalanced arenas. Every match is fast, unpredictable and always different.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n2 TO 4 PLAYER LOCAL GAME\nPerfect for game nights with mates and same-screen play.\n\nSIMPLE AND ACCESSIBLE CONTROLS\nEasy to pick up, even for new players.\n\nUNIQUE RANGED COMBAT\nGrab projectiles, charge your shots and knock your opponents out of the level.\n\nEVOLVING ARENAS\nLevels collapse during combat and become increasingly dangerous.\n\nREVENGE MODE\nEven when eliminated, you can influence the match and cause spectacular comebacks.\n\nHIGH REPLAYABILITY\nDynamic levels and special stages that break up the pace with varied objectives.\n\nFree to play, Royal Vermin is designed to keep every match tight until the end and make you want to play just one more round.",
